        "You feel mild cramps in your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + ".",
        "Your body relaxes as the cramps relent."],
        ["You feel the contractions in your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + ".",
        "You endure a stronger contraction than usual in your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + ".",
        "You take a small moment to catch your breath."],
        ["Your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? "uterine" : "anal") + " contractions grip your body hard.",
        "Your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + " contracts painfully.",
        "You feel the contraction lessen, but there's little reprieve."],
        ["The pressure in your pelvis feels immense and unrelenting.",
        "The constant painful " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? "uterine" : "anal") + " contractions leaves you tired.",
        "The contractions lessen for a moment."],
        ["You feel like your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + " is at your limit, but contractions continue.",
        "Through the pain, you can feel your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? "cervix" : "sphincter") + " stretching.",
        "The painful contractions lessen momentarily."],
        ["The " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + " contractions continue despite how tiring they are.",
        "Movement from your child sets off a painful contraction.",
        "The contractions yield, but not entirely."],
        ["The " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? either("uterus","womb") : either("anus","colon")) + " contractions continue despite how tiring they are.",
        "Movement from your child sets off a painful contraction.",
        "The contractions yield, but not entirely."],
        ["Your " + ($birth.genital is "vagina" ? "cervix" : "sphincter") + " is suddenly relieved of pressure."],
        ["The contractions ease for a moment while your body gathers itself."],
        ["The contractions stop."]
    ]
},
"bound":{
    "hospital":[
