    "The Great Hawk manages to peck and tear away the painful bonds.",
    "Your right arm lies limp as the Great Hawk manages peck and tear them away for you.",
    "Your right arm is freed by the Great Hawk by tearing the bonds away with a sharp beak."],
    "bedroom":[
