    "Your right arm is released from a painful bind by the Black Wolf by chewing through it.",
    "Your right arm lies limp as the Black Wolf chews through your bonds.",
    "Your right arm is freed by the Black Wolf chewing through your bonds."]
}}>>
	<<set setup.birthPrompts.stage["forest shop"] to {"human":[
		[["You breathe through the pain. \"Good, just like that,\" Gwylan says."],["default"]],
		[["Another contraction makes you groan. Gwylan rubs your belly. \"Breathe. It will pass.\""],["default"]],
		[["Gwylan checks between your legs. You tense at <<nnpc_his \"Gwylan\">> touch. \"Not yet, dear,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["You grab Gwylan's arm as another contraction hits. \"I've got you,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["You spread your legs and push. Gwylan kneels in front of you, ready to help."],["default"]],
		[["You feel the baby move lower. \"Push again,\" Gwylan says. You grit your teeth and do as <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["The baby stretches you wide. You cry out. \"Slowly,\" Gwylan says. \"You're nearly there.\""],["default"]],
		[["The newborn cries in Gwylan's hands. You fall back against the pillows, panting."],["default"]],
		[["You catch your breath while Gwylan wraps the baby in a towel. \"One moment, dear,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["You lie back, too tired to move. Gwylan cleans you and checks the baby. \"All done,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]]
	]}>>
	<<set setup.birthPrompts.stage["forest shop"].wolf to [
		[["You breathe through the pain. \"Good, just like that,\" Gwylan says."],["default"]],
		[["Another contraction makes you groan. Gwylan rubs your belly. \"Breathe. It will pass.\""],["default"]],
		[["Gwylan checks between your legs. You tense at <<nnpc_his \"Gwylan\">> touch. \"Not yet, dear,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["You grab Gwylan's arm as another contraction hits. \"I've got you,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["You spread your legs and push. Gwylan kneels in front of you, ready to help."],["default"]],
		[["You feel a pup move lower. \"Push again,\" Gwylan says. You grit your teeth and do as <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["The pup stretches you wide. You cry out. \"Slowly,\" Gwylan says. \"You're nearly there.\""],["default"]],
		[["The newborn pup squirms in Gwylan's hands. You fall back against the pillows, panting."],["default"]],
		[["You catch your breath while Gwylan wraps the pup in a towel. \"One moment, dear,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]],
		[["You lie back, too tired to move. Gwylan cleans you and checks the pups. \"All done,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says."],["default"]]
	]>>
	<<set setup.birthPrompts.stageInitial["forest shop"] to {
		"human":[
			[["Gwylan puts a hand on your belly. \"It has started,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says. You nod and try to stay calm."],["default"]],
			[["Gwylan checks between your legs. \"Everything looks fine,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says. You let out a shaky breath."],["default"]],
			[["A stronger contraction makes you curl forward. Gwylan holds your shoulders until it passes."],["default"]],
			[["\"It's time to push,\" Gwylan says. You spread your legs and take a deep breath."],["default"]],
			[["You push until your body shakes. \"Keep going,\" Gwylan says, holding your hip."],["default"]],
			[["Gwylan looks between your legs. \"I can see <<if $birth.delivered is 0>>the baby<<else>>another baby... the <<= ordinalWritten($birth.delivered + 1)>> one<</if>>,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says. You push again."],["default"]],
			[["The baby stretches you wide. You cry out and grab Gwylan's hand."],["default"]],
			[["You give one last push. <<if $birth.delivered is 0>>The baby slips out and Gwylan catches it.<<elseif $birth.delivered lt 5>>Your <<= ordinalWritten($birth.delivered + 1)>> baby slips out and Gwylan catches it, adding another cry to the room.<<else>>Another baby slips into Gwylan's waiting hands. \"Still with me, dear?\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> asks, briefly glancing at the growing row of towels.<</if>>"],["default"]],
			[["Another baby moves lower. You groan as Gwylan <<if $birth.delivered is 1>>wraps the newborn in a towel<<elseif $birth.delivered lt 6>>settles the newest baby beside the others<<else>>makes room among the growing bundle of newborns<</if>>."],["default"]],
			[["The pain finally stops. \"It's over,\" Gwylan says. You close your eyes and rest."],["default"]]
		],
		"wolf":[
			[["Gwylan puts a hand on your belly. \"It has started,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says. You nod and try to stay calm."],["default"]],
			[["Gwylan checks between your legs. \"Everything looks fine,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says. You let out a shaky breath."],["default"]],
			[["A stronger contraction makes you curl forward. Gwylan holds your shoulders until it passes."],["default"]],
			[["\"It's time to push,\" Gwylan says. You spread your legs and take a deep breath."],["default"]],
			[["You push until your body shakes. \"Keep going,\" Gwylan says, holding your hip."],["default"]],
			[["Gwylan looks between your legs. <<if $birth.delivered is 0>>\"I can see the first pup,\"<<elseif $birth.delivered lt 6>>\"Here comes the <<= ordinalWritten($birth.delivered + 1)>> pup,\"<<else>>\"Another pup is coming. We'll count them properly once you're done,\"<</if>> <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says. You push again."],["default"]],
			[["The pup stretches you wide. You cry out and grab Gwylan's hand."],["default"]],
			[["You give one last push. The pup slips out and Gwylan catches it. <<if $birth.delivered is 0>>\"There's one,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says, quickly wrapping the squirming pup in a towel.<<elseif $birth.delivered lt 5>>\"That's the <<= ordinalWritten($birth.delivered + 1)>>,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says, placing the pup safely beside its siblings.<<elseif $birth.delivered is 5>>\"Six pups,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says, sounding impressed despite <<nnpc_his \"Gwylan\">> concern for you.<<elseif $birth.delivered is 6>>\"That's the sixth one! Wait—no, seven...\" Gwylan looks over the bundled pups and hurriedly recounts them. \"Yes, seventh. Definitely seventh.\"<<else>>Gwylan starts to announce the number, looks at the crowded nest of towels, and thinks better of it. \"Another healthy pup,\" <<nnpc_he \"Gwylan\">> says instead.<</if>>"],["default"]],
			[["Another pup moves lower. You groan as Gwylan <<if $birth.delivered is 1>>wraps the newborn in a towel<<elseif $birth.delivered lt 6>>settles the newest pup beside its siblings<<else>>shuffles the bundled pups around and quietly recounts the squirming litter<</if>>."],["default"]],
			[["The pain finally stops. \"It's over,\" Gwylan says. You close your eyes and rest."],["default"]]
		]
	}>>
	<<set setup.birthPrompts.bound["forest shop"] to ["Your right arm jerks against its bonds as Gwylan releases you from them.","Your right arm is released from a painful bind by Gwylan.","Your right arm lies limp as Gwylan removes your bonds.","Your right arm is freed by Gwylan."]>>
	<<run setup.rcbNormalizeBirthPrompts()>>
	<</if>>



	<<if _birthRebuildRuntime>>
		<<set $birth["dialog"] to {"randomPool":[],"forcedPool":[],"randomQueue":[],"forcedQueue":[]}>>
	<<updateFilters "static">>
	<<updateFilters "partner">>
	<<updateFilters "initial">>
	<<applyDialogFilters "randomFull" "randomPool" "static">>
	<<applyDialogFilters "forcedFull" "forcedPool" "static">>
	<<applyDialogFilters "randomPool" "randomPool" "partner">>
	<<applyDialogFilters "forcedPool" "forcedPool" "partner">>
	<<resetLastOptions>>
	<<getCombatDefaultsType>>
	<</if>>
	
	<<unset _birthRebuildRuntime>>
<</if>>
<<if $finish is 1>>
	<<set $birth.giveup to 1>>
	<<set $birth.passout to 0>>
	You stop trying to force yourself through each contraction. Your body keeps labouring without your direction, and the people around you take over where they can.
	<br><br>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Childbirth End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<<effects>>
	<<childbirtheffects>>
	<<Childbirth>>
	<<childbirthactions>>

	<<if $birth.stage gt 9>>
		<<set $birth.passout to 0>>
		<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Childbirth End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
	<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
		<<set $birth.passout to 1>>
		<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Childbirth End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
	<<else>>
		<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Childbirth]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<</if>> /* end safety-gate macro else */

:: Childbirth End
<<unset $childbirthstart>>
<<playerPrebirth>>
<<if $birth.giveup is 1 or $finish is 1>>
    <<if $finish is 1>><<encounterEndViolence>><</if>>
    You can't take it anymore.
    <br><br>
	You let go of the effort to manage every wave. The labour still takes its course, helped along by instinct and whoever is close enough to guide you through it.
	<br><br>
	When the hardest part is finally over, you are cleaned up as best as possible and left aching, shaken, and exhausted.
<<elseif $birth.passout is 1>>
	Your strength gives out all at once. The room blurs, the noise around you slipping into a dull rush as your body finally stops obeying you.
	<br><br>
	By the time your senses return, the worst of it is over. Someone has cleaned you up as best they can, and the ache left behind is deep enough to make every breath feel careful.
<<else>>
	<<if $birth.type isnot "hawk">>
		The final after-pains leave you shaking. Someone helps clean you up, checks the child<<if $birth.fetuscount gt 1>>ren<</if>>, and makes sure the bleeding has slowed before letting you rest.
		<br><br>
		You are sore, drained, and unsteady, but the labour is finally over.
	<<else>>
		The last of the tension drains from your body, leaving you weak and strangely light. The egg<<if $birth.fetuscount gt 1>>s are<</if>><<if $birth.fetuscount is 1>> is<</if>> gathered carefully while you are cleaned up.
		<br><br>
		Your muscles still twitch with after-pains, but the laying is finally over.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<!--modloader commented out-->
<<switch $birth.location>>
	<<case "hospital">>
<!--	<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Hospital Alternate 3]]>><</link>> -->
		<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Hospital 3]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
	<<case "wolf cave">>
<!--	<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Wolf Cave Alternate 2]]>><</link>> -->
		<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Wolf Cave 2]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
	<<case "forest shop">>
		<<if $birth.type is "wolf">>
			<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop Wolf]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 4]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "cottage">>
		<<link [[Next|Farm PC Birth 5]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
	<<case "asylum">>
		<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Asylum 3]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
	<<case "prison">>
		<<if $birth.type is "human">>
			<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Prison 3]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Prison Wolf]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "bedroom">>
		<<if $birth.partner is "Robin">>
<!--		<<link [[Next|Robin Bed Egg Laying Alternate]]>><</link>> -->
			<<link [[Next|Robin Bed Egg Laying]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<<elseif $birth.partner is "Kylar">>
			<<link [[Next|Kylar Bed Egg Laying]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Solo Bed Egg Laying]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "tower">>
		<<link [[Next|Bird Tower Player Egg Laying Realistic End]]>><<unset $birth>><</link>>
	<<case "waterdragon_nest">>
		<<if $waterDragonBirthContext and $waterDragonBirthContext.fertilised>>
			<<link [[Next|Water Dragon Pregnancy Laying End]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Water Dragon Egg Laying Realistic End]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "waterdragon_lab">>
		<<link [[Next|Water Dragon Lab Laying Realistic End]]>><</link>>
<</switch>>


:: Kylar Bed Egg Laying
<<effects>>
<<set [_eggnant, _eggnantGenital] to getPlayerPregnancyForBirth(true)>>
<<if playerIsPregnant() and childBaseSpecies(_eggnant.donorSpecies) is "hawk">>
	<<set $eggLayNumber to getChildrenOf(_eggnant.pregnancyId).length>>
<<else>>
	<<set $eggLayNumber to $harpyEggs.count>>
<</if>>

Kylar heaves a sigh of relief when you return to normal.<br>
You shake your head and <<if Transformations.partActive("bird", "plumage")>>puff up your plumage as you <</if>><<if $eggLayNumber gte 2>>gather your eggs into your arms<<else>>pick up your egg<</if>>, mind blank save for an overwhelming sensation of maternal bliss.

<<if playerIsPregnant() and childBaseSpecies(_eggnant.donorSpecies) is "hawk">>
	<<set _eggIcon to $eggLayNumber>><<wearProp `"hawk egg " + Math.clamp(_eggIcon, 1, 3)`>>
	<span class="lewd">You're certain the <<pluralise $eggLayNumber "egg is" "eggs are">> fertilised.</span> You should bring <<pluralise $eggLayNumber "it">> back to your nest. You pick up <<number $eggLayNumber>> <<birdicon "eggs">> fertilised bird <<pluralise $eggLayNumber "egg">>.
	<<if $eggLayNumber gte 2>>They're quite large, and you're left wondering how they all fit inside of you to begin with.<<else>>It's quite large, and you're left wondering why passing it didn't hurt more.<</if>>
	<<pregnancyFeats "pc">>
	<<endPlayerPregnancy $location "inventory">>
	<<set $harpyEggsPrevent to 28>>
<<else>>
	<<wearProp "bird egg">>
	<span class="blue">You're fairly certain the <<pluralise $eggLayNumber "egg">> shouldn't be fertilised, though.</span> <<tending_pick bird_egg $eggLayNumber $eggLayNumber>>
	<<unset $harpyEggs>>
	<<set $harpyEggsPrevent to 14>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Kylar Bed Egg Laying End]]>><<handheldon>><</link>>
<br>

:: Kylar Bed Egg Laying End
<<effects>>

<<He>> tries to act indignantly, but <<his>>
<<if C.npc.Kylar.dom lte 40>>
	flustered
<<else>>
	hungry
<</if>>
tone betrays <<him>>. "Can I help you clean up?" <<He>> very obviously wants to. You tell <<him>> that it's okay and request some privacy, and <<he>> leaves your room.
<br><br>
<<set $wardrobe_location to "wardrobe">>
<<wardrobeSelection true>>
<<radiooutfits>>
<<unset $kylarbed>><<unset $eggLayNumber>>
<<endevent>><<endcombat>>
<br><br>

<<if $renttime lte 0>>
	<<set $bus to "home">>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Next|Bedroom Bailey]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Next|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

