<</if>>

You gather yourself in the nest, weak from the laying but filled with a powerful maternal calm.
<br><br>

<<if playerIsPregnant() and childBaseSpecies(_eggnant.donorSpecies) is "hawk">>
	<<set _eggIcon to $eggLayNumber>><<wearProp `"hawk egg " + Math.clamp(_eggIcon, 1, 3)`>>
	<span class="lewd">You're certain the <<pluralise $eggLayNumber "egg is" "eggs are">> fertilised.</span> <<Number $eggLayNumber>> <<birdicon "eggs">> fertilised bird <<pluralise $eggLayNumber "egg has" "eggs have">> been added to the nest.
	<<if $eggLayNumber gte 2>>They're quite large, and you're left wondering how they all fit inside of you to begin with.<<else>>It's quite large, and you're left wondering how it fit inside of you to begin with.<</if>>
	<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
